\f1\fs28\b Google Ads API Tool - Design Document\b0\fs22\par
\par
\fs24\b Overview\b0\fs22\par
Villa Lithos is a vacation rental property located in Porto Rafti, Greece.\par
This tool provides internal, automated monitoring of Google Ads campaign performance for the property owner.\par
\par
\fs24\b Purpose\b0\fs22\par
\bullet  Monitor campaign performance metrics: impressions, clicks, cost, CTR, conversions\par
\bullet  Generate automated weekly performance reports\par
\bullet  Support data-driven budget and targeting decisions for the property owner\par
\bullet  Alert the property manager to significant changes in campaign performance\par
\par
\fs24\b Users\b0\fs22\par
Internal use only. The tool is accessed exclusively by the property owner (Yoni Avni) and their AI-powered personal assistant (Dvora). No external users, clients, or public access of any kind.\par
\par
\fs24\b API Usage\b0\fs22\par
\bullet  Read-only access to campaign metrics via the Google Ads API\par
\bullet  Queries cover: campaigns, ad groups, keywords, ads, and performance metrics\par
\bullet  No programmatic creation, modification, or deletion of ads, budgets, or bids\par
\bullet  Estimated API calls: fewer than 100 per day\par
\bullet  Data is fetched on demand or on a scheduled daily basis\par
\par
\fs24\b Architecture\b0\fs22\par
The tool runs as a private local service on the property owner's server (WSL2/Linux). It uses OAuth 2.0 for secure authentication. API responses are stored locally in a JSON file and surfaced to the owner via a private messaging interface.\par
\par
\fs24\b Data Handling\b0\fs22\par
\bullet  All data is stored locally and never shared with third parties\par
\bullet  No personal user data is collected\par
\bullet  The tool does not re-display or redistribute Google Ads data beyond the property owner\par
\bullet  Full compliance with the Google Ads API Terms of Service\par
\par
\f1\fs18 Villa Lithos | Porto Rafti, Greece | Internal Use Only | March 2026\par
